{%- comment -%}
  Education pictograms (2026-09-02) — the impact/b2b .rd-pic family (forest stroke, lime-700
  accent circle) plus five new marks for the five-ways-in ladder and the material band.
  Usage: {% render 'bbc-edu-pic', icon: 'tag' %}. Unknown/blank icon renders nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case icon -%}
